#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:1 of
msgid "Provide exponentially weighted (EW) calculations within each group."
msgstr "在每个组内提供指数加权（EW）计算。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:3 of
msgid "Center of mass: ``alpha = 1 / (1 + com)``."
msgstr "质心：``alpha = 1 / (1 + com)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:5 of
msgid "Span: ``alpha = 2 / (span + 1)``."
msgstr "跨度：``alpha = 2 / (span + 1)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:7 of
msgid "Half-life: ``alpha = 1 - exp(ln(0.5) / halflife)``."
msgstr "半衰期：``alpha = 1 - exp(ln(0.5) / halflife)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:9 of
msgid "Smoothing factor directly: ``0 < alpha <= 1``."
msgstr "直接指定平滑因子：``0 < alpha <= 1``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:11 of
msgid "Minimum observations in the window to produce a value."
msgstr "窗口中产生值所需的最小观测数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:13 of
msgid "Adjusted (weighted average) vs recursive form."
msgstr "调整（加权平均）形式 vs 递归形式。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:15 of
msgid "Ignore NaN positions (relative) vs absolute positioning."
msgstr "忽略 NaN 位置（相对定位）vs 绝对定位。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:17 of
msgid "Biased vs unbiased variance (std/var only)."
msgstr "有偏 vs 无偏方差（仅 std/var）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:19 of
msgid "Column(s) to aggregate. If None, all non-group-key columns."
msgstr "要聚合的列。如果为 None，则为所有非分组键列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:21 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) that define the order in which the window expands within each "
"group (equivalent to ``ORDER BY`` inside a MaxCompute ``OVER()`` clause)."
msgstr ""
"定义每个组内窗口展开顺序的列（等价于 MaxCompute ``OVER()`` 子句中的 "
"``ORDER BY``）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:25 of
msgid "Sort direction for each *order_by* column."
msgstr "每个 *order_by* 列的排序方向。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:27 of
msgid "Offset the EWM leading edge by N rows."
msgstr "将 EWM 前沿偏移 N 行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:29 of
msgid "Flip the EWM to run from the last row backward within each group."
msgstr "翻转 EWM，在每个组内从最后一行向后运行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:31 of
msgid "If True, restore output to input frame's row order after shuffle."
msgstr "如果为 True，在重排后恢复输出到输入帧的行顺序。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:34 of
msgid "Intermediate object; call an aggregation method to produce a LiteFrame."
msgstr "中间对象；调用聚合方法以生成 LiteFrame。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:39 of
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:40 of
msgid ""
"See :meth:`LiteFrame.ewm <maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.ewm>` for the "
"mathematical details on ``adjust``, ``ignore_na``, and ``bias``."
msgstr ""
"有关 ``adjust``、``ignore_na`` 和 ``bias`` 的数学细节，请参阅 :meth:`"
"LiteFrame.ewm <maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.ewm>`。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.ewm:44 of
msgid ""
"With ``placeback=True`` (the default), the output is aligned with the "
"input frame — row order and chunk layout are restored after the group-key"
" shuffle.  With ``placeback=False`` the output stays in reducer/hash-"
"partition order and is **not** aligned with the input. Row count is "
"always preserved."
msgstr ""
"当 ``placeback=True``（默认值）时，输出与输入帧对齐——行顺序和块布局在分组"
"键重排后恢复。当 ``placeback=False`` 时，输出保持在 reducer/哈希分区顺序"
"，并且与输入**不**对齐。行数始终保留。"

